  "_never_auto_comment": "Mods never inferred from wording. Most change what gets delivered rather than how it is built, so they are a deliberate user choice (dry-run would silently forbid writing files). ds-house only makes sense in a project that has an in-house design system; such a project opts in with allowAuto in <harness>/config/atoms.json. All of them stay attachable explicitly with @mod:<id>.",
  "never_auto": ["dry-run", "explain-to-me", "output-budget", "locale-en", "locale-es", "ds-house", "workflow-author"],

